        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Polky | Fiddle-driven family fun | Feb 14 - 15, 2026 | Fourth Stage"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/40152/polky_daria_perev_2024_yellow_duo_2__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "There is nothing like high-energy folk rhythms to chase away the winter blues. With joyful harmonies, lively spirit and unusual instruments, Toronto’s Polky will have you tapping your toes. \n\nPolky is a fiddle-driven, feminist folk band bringing the vibrant sounds of rural Polish music to North American audiences. Led by Ewelina Ferenc, 2022 Canadian Folk Music Award winner for Traditional Singer of the Year, and multi-instrumentalist Marta Solek, the group blends traditional Eastern European melodies with modern arrangements.  \n\nFeaturing rare instruments like..."
      }
    ],
