        "@value": "https://nac-cna.ca/en/event/40150"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Music Room 4: Good Vibrations | Mamadou Koïta | Feb 14 - 15, 2026 | Babs Asper Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/40150/bigbang-musicrooms-mamadou-koita-balafolasite-na_a-la-une__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Have you ever heard a n’goni? What about a balafon? The rhythmic yet melodic sounds will lift your spirits! \n\nMamadou Koïta is a talented singer-songwriter and virtuoso percussionist. Born in Burkina Faso to a musical family, he now resides in Montreal. From balafon to djembe, n'goni and more, Mamadou plays many traditional instruments. Mixing traditional sounds with modern influences, he has created his own Afro-fusion vibe. \n\nWant to try a djembe? If you are lucky, Mamadou might just give you the chance..."
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/en/event/40150"
      }
    ]
